{"title": "Heartstopper", "pageid": 4252, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Heartstopper", "categories": ["Weapon actions", "Constitution saving throws", "Actions which use weapon action DC", "Melee weapon attacks", "Actions", "Sources of Piercing damage"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Heartstopper.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Heartstopper.webp/300px-Heartstopper.webp, /w/images/c/cf/Heartstopper.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Heartstopper.webp/300px-Heartstopper.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Heartstopper.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>Smash an enemy's chest in and possibly inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chest_Trauma_(Condition)\" title=\"Chest Trauma (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chest Trauma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chest_Trauma_(Condition)\" title=\"Chest Trauma (Condition)\">Chest Trauma</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Smash an enemy's chest in and possibly inflict <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Chest_Trauma_(Condition)\" title=\"Chest Trauma (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chest Trauma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chest_Trauma_(Condition)\" title=\"Chest Trauma (Condition)\">Chest Trauma</a>. \n</p>\n<span style=\"color: white;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\"><a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">Undead</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Constructs\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Constructs\">constructs</a> can't get Chest Trauma.</span></span><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/42px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/28px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Action</a></dd><dt>Damage: 1~4 + modifiers</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/46px-D4_Physical.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/62px-D4_Physical.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/D4_Physical.png/31px-D4_Physical.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"31\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/D4_Physical.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-piercing\">1d4 + <a href=\"/wiki/Finesse\" title=\"Finesse\">Strength or Dexterity modifier</a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"