ition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Chest Trauma\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9a/Chest_Trauma_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Chest_Trauma_(Condition)\" title=\"Chest Trauma (Condition)\">Chest Trauma</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: 2  turns</p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (Weapon action DC&nbsp;+&nbsp;2)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/Dice_rolls#Weapon_action_DC\" title=\"Dice rolls\">Weapon action DC</a>&nbsp;+&nbsp;2)</p>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" title=\"Disadvantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/41px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/55px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disadvantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png/27px-Disadvantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Disadvantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disadvantage\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Disadvantage\">Disadvantage</a> on Constitution <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throws\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throws\">Saving Throws</a> and has one fewer action.</li>\n<li>Removed by healing.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by wielding the following weapon types with <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a>:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Morningstars\" title=\"Morningstars\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/25px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/38px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/50px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Morningstars\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png/25px-Morningstars_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/65/Morningstars_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Morningstars\" title=\"Morningstars\">Morningstars</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The Chest Trauma condition caused by Heartstopper subtracts one <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/25px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/38px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Action Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/25px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Action from the affected creature. Chest Trauma does not affect <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/25px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/38px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Bonus Action Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/25px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Bonus actions nor <span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/25px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/38px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Reaction Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/25px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Reactions.</li></ul>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715061337\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.093 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.097 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3862/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 69998/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 25433/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.033/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1443035/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n115.10%   91.688     53 Template:Trim\n100.00%   79.657      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   79.657      1 -total\n 23.73%   18.904      2 Template:SmCond\n 19.33%   15.400     10 Template:Icon_text\n 12.59%   10.030      5 Template:Icon_link\n 11.65%    9.282      1 Template:Condition\n 11.45%    9.117      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n  8.45%    6.733      5 Template:Main_namespace_only\n  7.89%    6.286      2 Template:Template_style\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:4252-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715061337 and revision id 385459. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}